{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enter the world of TORSO TENNIS: a sports-like roguelike. DRAFT and GRAFT to perfect your TORSO and win the season. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">WISHLIST TO BECOME A TENNIS GOD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830890/extras/trash_17.gif?t=1744214457\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">High-intensity grid-based multi-ball tennis gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  Upgrade &amp; Win. Level up your LIMBS, get perma-boosts from TATTOOS, and YOINK limbs from your defeated opponents.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tons of builds. Find new limb + tattoo combinations that absolutely wreck your foes and break the game.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Builds To Try</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spawn CRITTERS that serve tennis balls, upgrade them to max capacity for an extremely offensive build that showers your opponent with tennis balls.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Run a debuff build by hitting your opponent with CHEEZBALLS, and just straight-up throw TRASH onto their court.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Go full Defense mode with a DINO build and protect your court with SHELLS, then find an opening to unleash your &quot;Trigger Happy&quot; tattoo and unload a full clip of tennis balls in a fraction of a second.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2830890?t=1744214457","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2830890?t=1744214457","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830890/697f209ceb6a3c4d825b45b2f55b0d3ee98eae40/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744214457","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.s